{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "9f1c9e2a-4b3d-4a4e-9a3a-6a1f0b2c1e01",
    "name": "IPRS Backend - Conversation Relay & Payment Flow",
    "description": "APIs for the onboarding flow: OTP auth, backend-driven Typebot conversation relay, and PayU payment integration.\n\n## Global envelopes\n\nSuccess: `{ \"success\": true, \"data\": { ... }, \"meta\"?: { ... } }`\n\nError: `{ \"success\": false, \"error\": { \"code\": \"...\", \"message\": \"...\", \"details\"?: { ... } } }`\n\nCommon error codes: `VALIDATION_ERROR` (422, bad request body/params), `UNAUTHORIZED` (401, missing/invalid/expired token), `FORBIDDEN` (403), `NOT_FOUND` (404), `TYPEBOT_NOT_CONFIGURED` (503), `TYPEBOT_REQUEST_FAILED`, `UPLOAD_ERROR` (400, file too large/bad multipart), `INTERNAL_ERROR` (500).\n\n## Flow\n\n1. `POST /auth/send-otp` with a phone number.\n2. `POST /auth/verify-otp` with the same phone + the OTP -> get back a JWT `token`. This request's test script auto-saves it into the `{{token}}` collection variable.\n3. `POST /conversation/message` with an empty body `{}` to start the Typebot session.\n4. Advance the chat through questions and document uploads (`/conversation/upload`).\n5. Pre-payment review & `POST /payment/initiate` to generate PayU payment hash & transaction ID.\n6. PayU checkout submission or simulated `POST /payment/callback` webhook confirmation.\n7. Check transaction status with `GET /payment/status/{{txnId}}` or history with `GET /payment/history`.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "baseUrl", "value": "http://localhost:4000", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "token", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "phone", "value": "919892807545", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "payuKey", "value": "zJ2jYh", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "payuSalt", "value": "QB0YB88AVqKnFYjetWGR7ZXBvlhczjPl", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "txnId", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "udf1", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "firstname", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "email", "value": "", "type": "string" }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Auth",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Send OTP",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"phone\": \"{{phone}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/send-otp",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["auth", "send-otp"]
            },
            "description": "phone must match /^\\+?[1-9]\\d{9,14}$/ (9-14 digits, optional leading +). In dev (OTP_PROVIDER=mock), data.otp echoes the OTP."
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "200 OK (mock provider, dev)",
              "originalRequest": {
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
                "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"phone\": \"{{phone}}\"\n}" },
                "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/send-otp", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["auth", "send-otp"] }
              },
              "status": "OK",
              "code": 200,
              "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json; charset=utf-8" }],
              "body": "{\n  \"success\": true,\n  \"data\": {\n    \"message\": \"OTP sent\",\n    \"otp\": \"123456\"\n  }\n}"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Verify OTP",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "  const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('token', json.data.token);",
                  "  if (json.data.user) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('udf1', String(json.data.user.id || ''));",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('firstname', json.data.user.name || 'Member');",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('email', json.data.user.email || '');",
                  "  }",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"phone\": \"{{phone}}\",\n  \"otp\": \"123456\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/verify-otp",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["auth", "verify-otp"]
            },
            "description": "On success, saves JWT token into {{token}} collection variable."
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "200 OK",
              "originalRequest": {
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
                "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"phone\": \"{{phone}}\",\n  \"otp\": \"123456\"\n}" },
                "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/verify-otp", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["auth", "verify-otp"] }
              },
              "status": "OK",
              "code": 200,
              "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json; charset=utf-8" }],
              "body": "{\n  \"success\": true,\n  \"data\": {\n    \"user\": {\n      \"id\": \"10827\",\n      \"phone\": \"919892807545\",\n      \"name\": \"CHOIRA MUSICTECHPRIVATE LIMITED\",\n      \"email\": \"suday7807@gmail.com\",\n      \"registrationStatus\": \"started\"\n    },\n    \"token\": \"eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9...\"\n  }\n}"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Logout",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/logout",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["auth", "logout"]
            },
            "description": "Blacklists current token."
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "200 OK",
              "originalRequest": {
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" }],
                "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/logout", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["auth", "logout"] }
              },
              "status": "OK",
              "code": 200,
              "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json; charset=utf-8" }],
              "body": "{\n  \"success\": true,\n  \"data\": {\n    \"loggedOut\": true\n  }\n}"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Conversation",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Send Message (start / continue)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" },
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"message\": \"Yes, I want to become a member\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/conversation/message",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["conversation", "message"]
            },
            "description": "Call with empty body `{}` to start a session, or send `{ \"message\": \"<answer>\" }` each turn."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Upload File (file input step)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "formdata",
              "formdata": [
                { "key": "file", "type": "file", "src": [] }
              ]
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/conversation/upload",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["conversation", "upload"]
            },
            "description": "multipart/form-data upload when `data.input.type === 'file input'`."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Payment",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "1. Initiate Payment",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200 || pm.response.code === 201) {",
                  "  const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "  if (json.data) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('txnId', json.data.txnId || '');",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('amount', json.data.amount || '1000.00');",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('payuKey', json.data.key || 'zJ2jYh');",
                  "    if (json.data.params) {",
                  "      if (json.data.params.udf1) pm.collectionVariables.set('udf1', json.data.params.udf1);",
                  "      if (json.data.params.firstname) pm.collectionVariables.set('firstname', json.data.params.firstname);",
                  "      if (json.data.params.email) pm.collectionVariables.set('email', json.data.params.email);",
                  "    }",
                  "  }",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" },
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"amount\": 1000,\n  \"productInfo\": \"IPRS Membership Onboarding Fee\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/payment/initiate",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["payment", "initiate"]
            },
            "description": "Initiates a PayU payment transaction in PENDING state, calculates the request SHA-512 hash, and automatically sets {{txnId}}, {{amount}}, {{udf1}}, {{firstname}}, and {{email}} into collection variables."
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "200 OK",
              "originalRequest": {
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [
                  { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" },
                  { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
                ],
                "body": {
                  "mode": "raw",
                  "raw": "{\n  \"amount\": 1000,\n  \"productInfo\": \"IPRS Membership Onboarding Fee\"\n}"
                },
                "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/payment/initiate", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["payment", "initiate"] }
              },
              "status": "OK",
              "code": 200,
              "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json; charset=utf-8" }],
              "body": "{\n  \"success\": true,\n  \"data\": {\n    \"payment\": {\n      \"paymentId\": \"1\",\n      \"userId\": \"10827\",\n      \"txnId\": \"IPRS_10827_1789476842612_f75e7774\",\n      \"amount\": 1000,\n      \"currency\": \"INR\",\n      \"status\": \"PENDING\",\n      \"createdAt\": \"2026-09-15T12:54:02.000Z\"\n    },\n    \"key\": \"zJ2jYh\",\n    \"txnId\": \"IPRS_10827_1789476842612_f75e7774\",\n    \"amount\": \"1000.00\",\n    \"currency\": \"INR\",\n    \"hash\": \"calculated_sha512_hash\",\n    \"actionUrl\": \"https://test.payu.in/_payment\",\n    \"params\": {\n      \"key\": \"zJ2jYh\",\n      \"txnid\": \"IPRS_10827_1789476842612_f75e7774\",\n      \"amount\": \"1000.00\",\n      \"productinfo\": \"IPRS Membership Onboarding Fee\",\n      \"firstname\": \"CHOIRA MUSICTECHPRIVATE LIMITED\",\n      \"email\": \"suday7807@gmail.com\",\n      \"phone\": \"919892807545\",\n      \"surl\": \"https://test.payu.in/admin/test_response\",\n      \"furl\": \"https://test.payu.in/admin/test_response\",\n      \"hash\": \"calculated_sha512_hash\",\n      \"udf1\": \"10827\"\n    }\n  }\n}"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "2. Simulate PayU Webhook Callback (Success)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "prerequest",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const salt = pm.collectionVariables.get('payuSalt') || 'QB0YB88AVqKnFYjetWGR7ZXBvlhczjPl';",
                  "const key = pm.collectionVariables.get('payuKey') || 'zJ2jYh';",
                  "const status = 'success';",
                  "const udf1 = pm.collectionVariables.get('udf1') || '10827';",
                  "const email = pm.collectionVariables.get('email') || 'suday7807@gmail.com';",
                  "const firstname = pm.collectionVariables.get('firstname') || 'CHOIRA MUSICTECHPRIVATE LIMITED';",
                  "const productinfo = 'IPRS Membership Onboarding Fee';",
                  "const amount = pm.collectionVariables.get('amount') || '1000.00';",
                  "const txnid = pm.collectionVariables.get('txnId');",
                  "",
                  "// Reverse hash: salt|status|udf10..udf1|email|firstname|productinfo|amount|txnid|key",
                  "const elements = [salt, status, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', udf1, email, firstname, productinfo, amount, txnid, key];",
                  "const str = elements.join('|');",
                  "const hash = CryptoJS.SHA512(str).toString();",
                  "pm.variables.set('calculated_callback_hash', hash);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"txnid\": \"{{txnId}}\",\n  \"status\": \"success\",\n  \"amount\": \"{{amount}}\",\n  \"productinfo\": \"IPRS Membership Onboarding Fee\",\n  \"firstname\": \"{{firstname}}\",\n  \"email\": \"{{email}}\",\n  \"udf1\": \"{{udf1}}\",\n  \"mihpayid\": \"403993715531234567\",\n  \"mode\": \"UPI\",\n  \"bank_ref_num\": \"UPI/2026/987654\",\n  \"key\": \"{{payuKey}}\",\n  \"hash\": \"{{calculated_callback_hash}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/payment/callback",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["payment", "callback"]
            },
            "description": "Simulates PayU's webhook callback to update transaction status to SUCCESS. The pre-request script calculates the reverse SHA-512 hash dynamically using {{payuSalt}}, {{amount}}, and {{txnId}}."
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "200 OK",
              "originalRequest": {
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [
                  { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
                  { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }
                ],
                "body": {
                  "mode": "raw",
                  "raw": "{\n  \"txnid\": \"{{txnId}}\",\n  \"status\": \"success\",\n  \"amount\": \"1000.00\",\n  \"productinfo\": \"IPRS Membership Onboarding Fee\",\n  \"firstname\": \"CHOIRA MUSICTECHPRIVATE LIMITED\",\n  \"email\": \"suday7807@gmail.com\",\n  \"udf1\": \"10827\",\n  \"mihpayid\": \"403993715531234567\",\n  \"mode\": \"UPI\",\n  \"bank_ref_num\": \"UPI/2026/987654\",\n  \"key\": \"zJ2jYh\",\n  \"hash\": \"calculated_reverse_hash\"\n}"
                },
                "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/payment/callback", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["payment", "callback"] }
              },
              "status": "OK",
              "code": 200,
              "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json; charset=utf-8" }],
              "body": "{\n  \"success\": true,\n  \"data\": {\n    \"paymentId\": \"1\",\n    \"userId\": \"10827\",\n    \"txnId\": \"IPRS_10827_1789476842612_f75e7774\",\n    \"mihPayId\": \"403993715531234567\",\n    \"amount\": 1000,\n    \"currency\": \"INR\",\n    \"status\": \"SUCCESS\",\n    \"paymentMode\": \"UPI\",\n    \"bankRefNo\": \"UPI/2026/987654\",\n    \"productInfo\": \"IPRS Membership Onboarding Fee\",\n    \"customerName\": \"CHOIRA MUSICTECHPRIVATE LIMITED\",\n    \"customerEmail\": \"suday7807@gmail.com\",\n    \"customerPhone\": \"919892807545\"\n  }\n}"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "3. Get Payment Status by TxnId",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/payment/status/{{txnId}}",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["payment", "status", "{{txnId}}"]
            },
            "description": "Fetches status of the transaction {{txnId}} for the authenticated member."
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "200 OK",
              "originalRequest": {
                "method": "GET",
                "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" }],
                "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/payment/status/{{txnId}}", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["payment", "status", "{{txnId}}"] }
              },
              "status": "OK",
              "code": 200,
              "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json; charset=utf-8" }],
              "body": "{\n  \"success\": true,\n  \"data\": {\n    \"paymentId\": \"1\",\n    \"userId\": \"10827\",\n    \"txnId\": \"IPRS_10827_1789476842612_f75e7774\",\n    \"mihPayId\": \"403993715531234567\",\n    \"amount\": 1000,\n    \"currency\": \"INR\",\n    \"status\": \"SUCCESS\",\n    \"paymentMode\": \"UPI\",\n    \"bankRefNo\": \"UPI/2026/987654\"\n  }\n}"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "4. Get Payment History",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/payment/history",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["payment", "history"]
            },
            "description": "Lists all payment transactions for the authenticated member."
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "200 OK",
              "originalRequest": {
                "method": "GET",
                "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" }],
                "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/payment/history", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["payment", "history"] }
              },
              "status": "OK",
              "code": 200,
              "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json; charset=utf-8" }],
              "body": "{\n  \"success\": true,\n  \"data\": [\n    {\n      \"paymentId\": \"1\",\n      \"userId\": \"10827\",\n      \"txnId\": \"IPRS_10827_1789476842612_f75e7774\",\n      \"amount\": 1000,\n      \"status\": \"SUCCESS\",\n      \"paymentMode\": \"UPI\"\n    }\n  ]\n}"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
